`LoanLedger` creates and updates equipment loans. `createLoan` validates non-empty string fields, assigns sequential IDs `L000001`, `L000002`, and so on, begins each loan in `REQUESTED`, preserves creation order, and copies all supplied objects. `updateLoanStatus` must find the loan whose ID exactly matches `id`; missing IDs throw `RangeError`. An `APPROVED` update requires a reviewer, while other statuses clear the reviewer. `generateReport` returns copied loans in creation order and counts each status. Returned or supplied objects must never alias internal state, and a failed operation must not mutate state.

